# Kubernetes is retired

The k8s cluster is gone. Do not run `k8s/deploy.sh` or `kubectl apply` for this app.

When the user asks to deploy, from the repo root on cyberdev01:

`deploy/docker/scripts/deploy-app.sh [all|backend|frontend]`

See `packages/shared/docs/application-overview/docker-deployment.md`.
